{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13602410","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13602410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"narration:0:1360240001:0":{"text":"色々と準備を終え、翌日の朝、人々は再びこの場所に集まった――","source_cn":"一番准备后，第二天清晨，大家齐聚此处——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x637B769E15C1D807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1360241001:1":{"text":"春の暁光に照らされ、司会のクインが挨拶の言葉を述べる。","source_cn":"迎着春日的晨辉，洛桑作为主持，致辞发言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1990499E183D3EF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360241002:1":{"text":"皆さん、本日この大陸に、新たな祭日<style=\"highlight\">「暁光祭」</style>が誕生しました！","source_cn":"诸位，从今天开始，大陆多了一个新的节日——<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38F739D37CE2E66A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360241003:1":{"text":"偉大なるメイジ・マーリンが大陸を巡り、カタストロフを封じ、芸術で混乱を鎮め、大陸に春と光をもたらしたことを記念する日です！","source_cn":"这个节日纪念伟大的魔法师梅林巡游大陆，封印恶魔，用美妙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BF61660CD5B9FDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360241004:0":{"text":"我輩の鐘で、大陸中にこの知らせを届けた。","source_cn":"吾已然用钟声，将这一节日昭告四方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69ACC88E2D11B29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1360241005:0":{"text":"今頃は、エスペリア中に新たな祭日の誕生が伝わっているはずだ。","source_cn":"大陆的每一处应当都已然知晓，新的节日已然诞生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D71944F1EAB7ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360241006:1":{"text":"そして今回のテーマは、ずばり音楽です！ぜひ、各々が得意とする音色を響かせ、麗しき春を迎えましょう！","source_cn":"而本次节日，以音乐为主题，大家请用自己最美妙的声音，来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BA254D9D6E06389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1360241007:0":{"text":"ドレアルが鐘を鳴らし、クインが弦をつま弾く。続いてガルダと旅館のスタッフたちが力強く太鼓を打ち鳴らした……","source_cn":"顿里尔轻敲钟声，洛桑拨响琴弦，格尔达带着旅店的店员们敲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F324B428DEEB57D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1360241008:1":{"text":"他にも笛を吹く者やベルを鳴らす者。そしてそれ以上に多くの人たちが、音楽に導かれるように自然と歌い出す……","source_cn":"有人吹笛，有人摇铃，但更多的，是人们随着美妙的合奏，自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CFB569C18D78EE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1360241009:0":{"text":"美しい旋律が、太陽の光のようにスノーシダー町の隅々に降り注いだ――","source_cn":"美妙的音乐犹如阳光一般，洒遍雪松镇的每个角落——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2323FFADCB92E12A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1360241010:0":{"text":"さて、今度こそ本当に出発の時間です。これからは、旅の先々で暁光祭を宣伝しますよ！","source_cn":"各位，我也该再次出发了！相信我，无论走到哪里，我也会帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52A947612C8757C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1360241011:0":{"text":"来年は別のテーマで開催するとしても、司会は必ずこのボクにやらせてくださいね！","source_cn":"等到明年，就算主题不是音乐了，也请一定要交给我主持呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE82262E48033C695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1360241012:1":{"text":"では、よい暁光祭を！","source_cn":"各位，晨辉节快乐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x904654E84188F330","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:19:1360242001:0":{"text":"新たな祭日の誕生を告げるドレアルの鐘が響き渡り、辺りは人々の歓声と美しい旋律に包まれた……","source_cn":"新节日的诞生随着顿里尔的昭告响彻四方，随之而起的，是人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EBB961A0AF5DB80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:20:1360242002:0":{"text":"同時刻、とある場所――","source_cn":"而在某一个角落……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CBE308C08BBBF2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1360243001:1":{"text":"やれやれ、マーリンの奴が何をやっても驚かないけど、セレスチアルお墨付きの祭日まで作っちゃうなんて、ほんと大したものだよ。","source_cn":"哎呀呀，虽然梅林这家伙干什么都很正常，但直接创造一个有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A85E77EB124BEF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1360243002:1":{"text":"でもさあ、今回の件では僕もけっこう貢献してるよねえ？","source_cn":"只不过，这次的节日至少有一多半的功劳应该归我吧？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE452F708782F0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1360243003:0":{"text":"そうだよ！僕にだって命名権があってもいいはずだよね！半分はベリル祭って名乗ってもいいぐらいだよ！","source_cn":"对吧对吧，明明应该是我！我也应该有冠名权！这个节日有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0390080822B38C11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1360243004:0":{"text":"……いや、なんかキモいからやめよ。","source_cn":"……啊，算了，有点恶心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86AC8E31CB84F666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1360243005:0":{"text":"はぁ、僕は寛大だから、人間たちの不公平も笑って許すさ。","source_cn":"算了，宽宏大量的我就这样面对人类的不公平吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBF2CA65359A4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1360243006:0":{"t